  m_Name: ArcadeGameKelpwood
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 86
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Kelpwood
  Description: 'Anglers only - a hunt through a ball of kelp, strands reaching out from the core in
    every direction. Sweep your eraser onto a rival pilot to lock them - one creature leaves
    your school and hunts them, and every bite is a point that silences them. Tame the herds
    grazing the kelp, or take an omni crystal, to grow your school; dash to your other group
    to shake a hunter. Higher intensities thicken the kelp, thin the herds and crystals, and
    add danger tips and collars. First team to the target wins.'
